    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people want to help, but it doesn't change what's happening. my body is failing, my friends are gone... it feels like i'm just watching a movie of a life i've already lived. there's no \"footing\" to find when the ground itself is disappearing. it feels more like i'm just lingering, if that makes sense.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
